#: www/ActivationWizard.js:103
msgid "%(appliance_name)s Appliance is now activated. Click \"Finish\" to access the management interface (which may take a while)."
msgstr "%(appliance_name)s Appliance 現已啟用。按一下「Finish」以存取管理介面 (可能需要一些時間)。"

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:71
#, javascript-format
msgid "A license file has been sent to <strong class=\"email-address\">%s</strong>. This file is necessary to activate the system. For this, please carry out the following steps: <ol><li>Open the email.</li><li>Save the attachment (ucs.license) on your computer.</li><li>Click the button 'Upload license file'.</li><li>Select the file (ucs.license) you just saved.</li><li>Confirm the selection.</li></ol>Once the activation has been finished your email address will be sent to the app provider. The app provider may contact you."
msgstr "授權檔案已寄送至 <strong class=\"email-address\">%s</strong>。啟用系統時需要這個檔案。為此，請執行下列步驟: <ol><li>開啟電子郵件。</li><li>將附件 (ucs.license) 儲存到您的電腦。</li><li>按一下「Upload license file」按鈕。</li><li>選擇您剛才儲存的檔案 (ucs.license)。</li><li>確認選擇。</li></ol>啟用完成後，您的電子郵件地址將會傳送給應用程式供應商。應用程式供應商可能會與您聯絡。"

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:68
msgid "Activation of %(appliance_name)s Appliance"
msgstr "啟用 %(appliance_name)s Appliance"

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:102
msgid "Activation successful!"
msgstr "啟用成功！"

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:261
msgid "An error has occurred. More information on how to avoid this error can be found <a href=\"https://help.univention.com/t/14544\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">in our support database</a>."
msgstr "發生錯誤。有關如何避免這個錯誤的詳細資訊，請參閱<a href=\"https://help.univention.com/t/14544\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">我們的技術支援資料庫</a>。"

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:148 www/ActivationWizard.js:152
msgid "An unknown error has occurred."
msgstr "發生不明錯誤。"

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:252
msgid "An unknown error occurred. It is possible that a browser addon blocks sending the request to \"license.univention.de\". More information how to avoid this error can be found <a href=\"https://help.univention.com/t/7698\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">in our support database</a>."
msgstr "發生不明錯誤。可能是瀏覽器外掛程式封鎖了傳送至「license.univention.de」的要求。有關如何避免這個錯誤的詳細資訊，請參閱<a href=\"https://help.univention.com/t/7698\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">我們的技術支援資料庫</a>。"

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:44
msgid "E-mail address"
msgstr "電子郵件地址"

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:254
msgid "Error "
msgstr "錯誤 "

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:56
msgid "If you already have a license file you can <a href=\"#upload\">skip this step and upload the license</a>."
msgstr "如果您已有授權檔案，可以<a href=\"#upload\">忽略這個步驟並上傳授權</a>。"

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:75
msgid "If you did not receive an email, please check your SPAM directory or <a href=\"#register\"> request the email again</a>."
msgstr "如果您沒有收到電子郵件，請檢查您的垃圾郵件目錄，或<a href=\"#register\">再次要求寄送電子郵件</a>。"

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:37
msgid "License request for %(appliance_name)s Appliance"
msgstr "%(appliance_name)s Appliance 的授權要求"

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:52
#, javascript-format
msgid "More details about the activation can be found in the <a href=\"https://docs.software-univention.de/manual/%s/de/central-management-umc/umc.html#central-license\" target=\"_blank\">UCS manual</a>."
msgstr "有關啟用的詳細資訊，請參閱 <a href=\"https://docs.software-univention.de/manual/%s/de/central-management-umc/umc.html#central-license\" target=\"_blank\">UCS 手冊</a>。"

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:47
msgid "No valid email address."
msgstr "電子郵件地址無效。"

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:40
msgid "Please enter a valid email address in order to activate %(appliance_name)s Appliance. The activation is mandatory to deploy the system. In the next step you can upload the license file that has been sent to your email address."
msgstr "請輸入有效的電子郵件地址以啟用 %(appliance_name)s Appliance。部署系統時必須進行啟用。在下一個步驟中，您可以上傳已寄送至您電子郵件地址的授權檔案。"

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:118
msgid "Request activation"
msgstr "要求啟用"

#: www/main.js:47
msgid "Switch language"
msgstr "切換語言"

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:260
msgid "The following error occurred:"
msgstr "發生下列錯誤:"

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:287
msgid "The server is not responding. Please restart the system."
msgstr "伺服器沒有回應。請重新啟動系統。"

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:81
msgid "Upload license file"
msgstr "上傳授權檔案"

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:243
msgid "[%(appliance_name)s Appliance] Activation Error"
msgstr "[%(appliance_name)s Appliance] 啟用錯誤"

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:45
msgid "mail@example.org"
msgstr ""

#: www/ActivationWizard.js:71
msgid "your email address"
msgstr "您的電子郵件地址"
